sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Shopper as 구매자
  participant Shop as Web Shop
  participant Pay as Payment Gateway
  participant Stock as Inventory

  Shopper->>+Shop: 장바구니 결제 요청
  par Reserve stock
    Shop->>+Stock: Reserve the selected items
    Stock-->>-Shop: Reserved
  and Authorize payment
    Shop->>+Pay: Authorize card
    Pay-->>-Shop: Approved
  end
  Note over Shop,Pay: Charges are captured after shipping
  opt Coupon applied
    loop For every coupon
      Shop->>Shop: Validate coupon
      Shop-)Stock: 쿠폰 사용 기록
    end
  end
  alt Payment approved
    Shop-->>Shopper: 주문이 접수되었습니다
  else Card declined
    Pay--xShop: 402 Declined
    Shop-->>-Shopper: 결제에 실패했습니다
  end
  Note right of Stock: 재고 예약은 15분 뒤 만료됩니다
